    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Galarth",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In his youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. He then became sovereign of his realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Fedroth",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Known in her times as the mightiest of all adepts of the black art, this lord was slain by the inquisitor Vorgel who ended her reign of terror. She is now resurrected as an undead with the intention to subjugate every mortal to her will.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dagar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zythaar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp gets Kraken",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor\r\u0022Sir, the Holy Relic is allowing us to take control of the Mythical Kraken!\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead gets Kraken",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor\r\u0022Sir, the Holy Relic is allowing us to take control of the Mythical Kraken!\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp IntroSea Creature",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor\r\u0022The ancient pack has been broken. The magic that held the sea back is no more. The Marshdwellers and sea creatures will attempt to regain control. We must be careful at all cost.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Our Mages are working hard on creating a spell that will allow us to control some of the sea creatures. The journey to defeat the Elves may not be possible without these creatures.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor\r\u0022The weak pitiful magic that binded this land together no longer exists. The tide will rise and the creatures of the sea will once again be the rulers. We shall not let this happen for death in inevitable. Those that die join the Undead Hordes.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022This land is dead and all of its possessions will fall to the Undead Hordes. Including a mysterious artifact that will allow us to control the sea creatures. Once we have that possession the Elves will be destroyed once and for all.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Undead Convoy Success",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022My Lord, the convoy has safely reached its destination.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Convoy Success",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S208SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S208EV0009",
